<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh taka ends flat on dollar inflow.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh taka ends flat on dollar inflow.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh taka closed unchanged at 42.3800/42.3925 to the dollar in interbank trading on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the taka remained mostly steady and did not ease as anticipated because of dollar inflow. The taka was quoted at 42.3825/42.3925 against dollar in early trade.</p>
<p>The interbank call money rates closed unchanged at 4.5 percent to 5.25 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
